  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{首|くび}を{傾|かたむ}ける (tilt one's head — often expressing puzzlement)\n・{耳|みみ}を{傾|かたむ}ける (listen attentively)\n・{情熱|じょうねつ}を{傾|かたむ}ける (devote one's passion)\n・{全力|ぜんりょく}を{傾|かたむ}ける (pour all one's efforts)\n・グラスを{傾|かたむ}ける (raise/tilt a glass — implies drinking)\n\nThe phrase {耳|みみ}を{傾|かたむ}ける is a set expression meaning to listen carefully or pay attention to someone's words.",
